  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This United Nations Joint Programme (UNJP) targets rural women specifically, with the objective of increasing their knowledge of business development and green innovation and improving their access to financing to empower rural women and drive sustainable economic growth in northern communities. Using the data obtained as a result of the Country Gender Assessment (CGA) and creating opportunities for networking, learning, and participation, the project will provide effective measures that contrib</narrative>
